Dragon Princes. Dragon Princes wear ornate, burnished armor that makes them resistant to fire. They may re-roll any failed Armor saves made against fire based attacks, such as Warpfire, Flame Cannons, Ball Of Flame, Flame Breath, etc. Dragon Princes are exceptionally rare, so only one unit can be taken per army as opposed to one unit per 1,000 рoints.
